    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1745">

                <pb facs="1137" n="1021" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg1021"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 718.1915/226.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Costa Rica to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of Costa Rica</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-25">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 25, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: I have the honor to
                    transmit to your excellency a translation of the reply which the Government of
                    Costa Rica made to the note<anchor n="8" xml:id="d1745-f1"/> of the Government
                    of Panama, in which the <pb facs="1138" n="1022" xml:id="pg1022"/> Minister for
                    Foreign Affairs of this country sets forth the reasons that move it to reject
                    the Award of the Chief Justice of the United States.</p>
                <p>While taking the liberty of calling your excellency’s attention to the arguments
                    made by my Government, I avail [etc.]</p>
                <closer>[Unsigned] [<signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">R. Brenes Mesén</hi></signed>.]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1745-f1" n="8" xml:id="d1745-f1-content">
                <p>The same as Inclosure 2 with Mr. Cresson’s despatch No. 331 of November 18.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
